      "content": "\"Containment and Fire Suppression Tactics: Upon establishing a secure perimeter, deploy firefighting teams to contain the fire using appropriate suppression techniques such as water, foam, or chemical agents, depending on the fire class. Prioritize ventilation to control smoke and heat buildup, ensuring firefighter safety. Utilize thermal imaging cameras to locate hotspots and prevent fire spread. Coordinate with the Incident Commander to adjust tactics based on real-time assessments. Maintain constant communication with all responding agencies to ensure a cohesive and effective suppression effort.\"",
      "source": "target",
